{"schemaVersion":1,"systemCode":"BSI:chu-Cyrl:Latn:1958","dependencies":[],"metadata":{"authority_id":"bsi","id":"1958","language":"iso-639-2:chu","source_script":"Cyrl","destination_script":"Latn","name":"BS 2979:1958 Transliteration of Cyrillic and Greek characters - Table D, Transliteration of Church Slavonic Cyrillic","url":"https://www.bsigroup.com","creation_date":"1958","confirmation_date":"2000-05","description":"BS 2979:1958, Table D: transliteration of Church Slavonic Cyrillic. The table\n    covers the full Church Slavonic alphabet including the yuses, ksi, psi, fita\n    and izhitsa, with the letters' numerical values annotated.","notes":["The digraph-letter pairs и and й are given as glyph variants in one row: и is romanized i with macron (long i) and the breve-marked variant й as i with breve (short i); likewise i and the diaeresis-marked variant (i-krataya glyph) are romanized i and i with diaeresis.","The Church Slavonic yus series: little yus e with ogonek, big yus o with ogonek, iotated little yus j plus e-ogonek, iotated big yus j plus o-ogonek; the iotated-e glyph je and the iotated-a digraph ja.","Omega is romanized o with macron. The digraph uk (o plus u, with the monograph-uk glyphs as variants) is romanized u with macron, the table also showing the alternative rendering as the two separate letters.","Fita is romanized f with dot above (distinguishing it from ef); izhitsa is romanized y with dot above.","Shcha is romanized s-caron plus t in this table. The hard sign is romanized u with breve (the table's footnote: it occurs only after consonants), and yery is romanized y.","The numerical-value column of the source annotates the letters used as numerals (a=1, v=2, g=3, d=4, e=5, dze=6, z=7, i=8, i=10, k=20, l=30, m=40, n=50, o=70, p=80, r=100, s=200, t=300, uk=400, f=500, kh=600, psi=700, omega=800, ts=900, ch=90, ksi=60, fita=9, izhitsa with the thousands sign); the footnote describes the titlo, the diaeresis marking thousands, and the thousands-sign constructions for 10000 and over. This map renders the letters, not the numeral values.","Transcribed visually from the scanned table page of the digitized BS 2979:1958 (BSI 05-2000 reprint); the fita and izhitsa cells were confirmed at 20x magnification."]},"stages":[{"kind":"stage","name":"main","rules":[{"kind":"parallel","rules":[{"kind":"sub","from":{"kind":"string","value":"ІА"},"to":{"kind":"string","value":"Ja"}},{"kind":"sub","from":{"kind":"string","value":"ОУ"},"to":{"kind":"string","value":"Ū"}},{"kind":"sub","from":{"kind":"string","value":"Ѹ"},"to":{"kind":"string","value":"Ū"}},{"kind":"sub","from":{"kind":"string","value":"Ѣ"},"to":{"kind":"string","value":"Ě"}},{"kind":"sub","from":{"kind":"string","value":"Ѥ"},"to":{"kind":"string","value":"Je"}},{"kind":"sub","from":{"kind":"string","value":"Ѧ"},"to":{"kind":"string","value":"Ę"}},{"kind":"sub","from":{"kind":"string","value":"Ѫ"},"to":{"kind":"string","value":"Ǫ"}},{"kind":"sub","from":{"kind":"string","value":"Ѩ"},"to":{"kind":"string","value":"Ję"}},{"kind":"sub","from":{"kind":"string","value":"Ѭ"},"to":{"kind":"string","value":"Jǫ"}},{"kind":"sub","from":{"kind":"string","value":"Ѯ"},"to":{"kind":"string","value":"Ks"}},{"kind":"sub","from":{"kind":"string","value":"Ѱ"},"to":{"kind":"string","value":"Ps"}},{"kind":"sub","from":{"kind":"string","value":"Ѕ"},"to":{"kind":"string","value":"Dz"}},{"kind":"sub","from":{"kind":"string","value":"Ж"},"to":{"kind":"string","value":"Ž"}},{"kind":"sub","from":{"kind":"string","value":"И"},"to":{"kind":"string","value":"Ī"}},{"kind":"sub","from":{"kind":"string","value":"Й"},"to":{"kind":"string","value":"Ĭ"}},{"kind":"sub","from":{"kind":"string","value":"Ї"},"to":{"kind":"string","value":"Ï"}},{"kind":"sub","from":{"kind":"string","value":"Щ"},"to":{"kind":"string","value":"Št"}},{"kind":"sub","from":{"kind":"string","value":"Ч"},"to":{"kind":"string","value":"Č"}},{"kind":"sub","from":{"kind":"string","value":"Ш"},"to":{"kind":"string","value"